# Full Throttle: "After this main phase, there are two additional combat phases. At the beginning of each combat this turn, untap all
# creatures that attacked this turn." (CR 500.8, 603.7b). Cast in the precombat main for the full {4}{R}{R}, it puts two combats
# before the turn's own, so a Fanatical Firebrand (1/1 haste) attacks three times: the untap at the beginning of the second and third
# combat frees it, and Bot2 goes from 20 to exactly 17 (not 19, 18 or 16). It ends the turn tapped, having attacked in the last one.

